			"git": {"repo": "https://github.com/pydicom/pydicom", "ref": "main", "paths": ["/src/pydicom/data/test_files/"], "strip": 4},
			"licence": "pydicom's repository is MIT, but many files are third-party samples (NEMA WG04, dclunie.com, TCIA, GDCM under BSD-3-Clause; each file's source is in its README.txt) and NEMA's licence is unstated", "redistribute": false, "size": "3 MB",
			"note": "pydicom's small test files: explicit, implicit and big-endian VR, files without meta information, deflate, JPEG baseline/extended (12-bit)/lossless, JPEG-LS lossless and near-lossless, JPEG 2000, RLE, RGB and YBR, palette colour, multi-frame RT dose, SR, private and UN sequences, truncated files, and dicomdirtests/ (a DICOMDIR with CT, CR and MR series in extension-less files)."
		},
