		//region rigged-extra (rigged and animated model formats: MD5, IQM, SMD, PMX, PMD, VMD and PSK/PSA; each subfolder's SOURCES.md lists every file)
		// Not fetched: the SOURCES.md in each format folder (md5, iqm, smd, pmx, pmd, vmd, psk) and every NOT-REDISTRIBUTABLE.txt were written by hand when the files were collected.
		// Every upstream commit named in those notes is still the branch tip (assimp 7629e9a, iqm 1077b9c, gene c7eace4, maya_mmd_tools 89f9987, babylon-mmd ccb750d, usd-mmd-plugins 8aaff35,
		// PMXParser 7e0c83c, io_scene_psk_psa 9c1c8ba, psk_psa_py 13df1ba, pyffi 7f4404d, Fortnite-Assets-Backup 800b235); Pmd2XML and Vmd2XML name none (tips a29fd26 and c5c57ae).
		// Where a folder also holds a hand-written note beside the fetched files, its files are plain URL entries pinned to a commit (with sha256), or subfolder Git entries, so a simulated fetch of the
		// folder is not "different" only because of the note.  pmd/mmdagent and vmd/mmdagent are slices of the MMDAgent_Example-1.8 zip (checked by size and CRC-32 against its central directory).
		// pmd/three-mmd and vmd/three-mmd come from three.js tag r171, the last release that still shipped examples/models/mmd.
		// Nothing in this category is untraceable or generated.
